# 05: a MOD on a knob (hold X on it) and the MOD tab.
title A MOD ON A KNOB
about A knob that moves by itself: hold X on the bass's TONE, press up for an LFO, set its depth and rate, then see it on the MOD tab.
caption MOD
run --demo --view song
